OL,3,GNEWSACancer patients call for early
OL,4,Amenopause support
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman with stage four breast cancer
OL,7,Fhas called for more support for those
OL,8,Fexperiencing menopause that has been
OL,9,Fbrought on due to their cancer
OL,10,Ftreatment.
OL,12,FGrace Warden, 31, from Norwich, said
OL,13,Fshe "didn't anticipate the severity" of
OL,14,Fthe side effects she would face when
OL,15,Fhaving treatment.
OL,17,FThe charity Menopause and Cancer has
OL,18,Flaunched its Call for Change campaign
OL,19,Furging clearer information about the
OL,20,Fpossible impacts of cancer treatment.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
