OL,3,GNEWSACancer patients call for early
OL,4,Amenopause support
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Department of Health and Social
OL,7,FCare said its National Cancer Plan
OL,8,Fwould ensure patients had a
OL,9,Fpersonalised plan "so the long-term
OL,10,Feffects of treatment, including
OL,11,Fmenopause, are recognised and built
OL,12,Finto their ongoing care".
